WEBVTT

00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:14.490
D3-Hub Guild Hall - Akiba

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:12.440
So, this is the new home for D.D.D?

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:15.310
It's the D3-Hub.

00:00:15.310 --> 00:00:18.560
By the way, is Shiroe okay?

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:20.060
No need to worry.

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:25.390
He's begun to take action
and went to see someone.

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:25.500
Platform Remains, Old Akiba Station - Akiba

00:00:25.810 --> 00:00:30.060
Thank you for coming... Mr. Shiroe.

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:35.730
Thank you for contacting me.
I was thinking I had to talk to you... Eins.

00:00:35.730 --> 00:00:38.020
About the "Akiba Government," right?

00:00:38.020 --> 00:00:40.480
If it's going to be an assembly,

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:43.060
it'll be a dual structure
with the Round Table Conference.

00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:46.060
So we'll have to deal with things accordingly.

00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:50.140
The Round Table Conference is a
well-intentioned mutual support group.

00:00:50.140 --> 00:00:55.560
It doesn't have the authority
to block the creation of a new assembly.

00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:59.140
The Akiba Government, founded
with the support of the People of the Land,

00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:02.520
also cannot eliminate
the Round Table Conference.

00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:04.270
That's just the official line.

00:01:04.270 --> 00:01:09.440
The Round Table Conference
has already collapsed.

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:13.350
The Black Sword Knights are now in Maihama
and have declared they'll just sit by.

00:01:13.350 --> 00:01:16.270
Shopping Street 8 also places
importance on the People of the Land

00:01:16.270 --> 00:01:18.480
and is trying to stabilize the flow of goods.

00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:20.020
As for Glendale, they even decided

00:01:20.020 --> 00:01:23.600
to officially leave the Round Table Conference.

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:27.230
Out of 12 seats, five are missing
in the Round Table Conference.

00:01:27.230 --> 00:01:29.060
What meaning does it now hold?

00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:34.730
Hey, hey... So does this mean
what Shiro said yesterday was right?

00:01:34.730 --> 00:01:37.140
It really did make me feel a bit beaten...

00:01:37.140 --> 00:01:41.310
Leaving the Round Table?
Founding the Akiba Government?

00:01:41.310 --> 00:01:43.390
That darn Eins...

00:01:43.390 --> 00:01:46.020
I wonder why I'm so clumsy...

00:01:46.020 --> 00:01:51.390
I could've discussed more.

00:01:51.390 --> 00:01:56.020
So, what'd you think, Strategist?

00:01:56.020 --> 00:02:01.270
I realized things have
moved on to the next phase.

00:02:01.270 --> 00:02:04.520
The Round Table Conference
might already be over.

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:06.020
What?

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:09.440
The Round Table Conference
is coming to an end.

