but there was no one
who bore full responsibility for it.

00:03:51.060 --> 00:03:54.730
That's what Eins grew
impatient about and pointed out.

00:03:54.730 --> 00:03:58.560
At the first meeting, I said we
should accept the People of the Land,

00:03:58.560 --> 00:04:01.770
and that we must live together with them.

00:04:01.770 --> 00:04:07.600
And yet, I never questioned the
Round Table Conference without them.

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:11.810
But in those messy days,
there was no way we could...

00:04:11.810 --> 00:04:17.270
I think we've entered a different phase.

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:19.390
Even the governing mechanism
of the People of the Land

00:04:19.390 --> 00:04:22.230
has two entities, the East and the West.

00:04:22.230 --> 00:04:26.350
Moreover, the Westelande side
includes Adventurers.

00:04:26.350 --> 00:04:30.100
I think it'll be hard for an organization
without the People of the Land in it

00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:34.060
to continue overseeing Akiba in the future.

00:04:34.060 --> 00:04:36.560
So Eins is right.

00:04:36.560 --> 00:04:41.100
He taught us the Round Table
Conference can no longer work.

00:04:41.100 --> 00:04:43.980
He chose to not run away.

00:04:43.980 --> 00:04:47.600
He's intending to take responsibility
for the fact that things can't go on like this.

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:51.730
Then are we going to participate
in this Akiba Government thing?

00:04:51.730 --> 00:04:53.980
That's...

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:58.980
Excuse me. A member of Honesty
brought a letter for you.

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:05.700
The Round Table Fractures

00:05:02.060 --> 00:05:04.520
"The Round Table Fractures."

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:09.940
What matter did you call me for today?

00:05:09.940 --> 00:05:13.890
It's about requesting your participation
in the Akiba Government, of course.

00:05:13.890 --> 00:05:16.690
Are you gonna ask me to persuade
the Round Table members?

00:05:16.690 --> 00:05:18.230
I don't care about that.

00:05:18.230 --> 00:05:19.270
What?

00:05:19.270 --> 00:05:24.850
I put more importance in process than results,
my own reputation than maturity.

00:05:24.850 --> 00:05:27.310
I was a small, vulgar man.

00:05:27.310 --> 00:05:29.310
That's why I've never achieved anything

00:05:29.310 --> 00:05:32.980
and people have had a low opinion of me.

00:05:32.980 --> 00:05:36.980
I questioned myself, "What do I need now?

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:41.480
What do I need to gain
in order to change Akiba?"

00:05:41.480 --> 00:05:43.810
The answer is...

00:05:43.810 --> 00:05:47.520
Mr. Shiroe. It's you.

00:05:47.520 --> 00:05:52.350
That's right. You created the
Round Table Conference in the first place.

00:05:52.350 --> 00:05:56.230
You also made a treaty with
the League of Freedom Cities Eastal

00:05:56.230 --> 00:05:59.810
and created new relationships
with the People of the Land.

00:05:59.810 --> 00:06:02.730
No, it wasn't just me.

00:06:02.730 --> 00:06:04.890
You had them agree to not
to politically meddle in Akiba

00:06:04.890 --> 00:06:08.770
by having Princess Rayneshia as a mediator.

00:06:08.770 --> 00:06:12.140
You negotiated with the
Kunie Tribe and had them agree

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:16.440
to furnish a political fund
you can almost say is limitless...

00:06:16.440 --> 00:06:19.310
At every turning point for all the
Round Table Conference's policies,

00:06:19.310 --> 00:06:22.980
you're always involved.

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:25.690
So I came to the conclusion

00:06:25.690 --> 00:06:29.060
that it'll work if I have you.

00:06:29.060 --> 00:06:34.940
In other words, it also
means it won't work without you.

00:06:34.940 --> 00:06:36.980
That's what I'd like to discuss with you.

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:43.440
Mr. Shiroe. I'd like to invite you
to join the Akiba Government.

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:49.800
Lounge, D3-Hub Guild Hall

00:06:45.770 --> 00:06:48.230
So you really are going to get married?

00:06:48.230 --> 00:06:50.270
Yes... Well...

00:06:50.270 --> 00:06:55.640
I heard that to you Adventurers,
getting married at this age is too early.

00:06:55.640 --> 00:07:00.230
But when you think about
my position, it's rather late.

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:06.350
Well... Daughters of duke families
are raised for that purpose, so...

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:13.020
We asked you to give the princess to Akiba!

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:12.820
Cinderella Castle - Japan 
Server - Maihama

00:07:14.810 --> 00:07:17.980
It's not that I disregarded you.

00:07:17.980 --> 00:07:22.770
If she was fine with the marriage,
then it'd be good if we went ahead with it.

00:07:22.770 --> 00:07:24.390
That is all I said.

00:07:24.390 --> 00:07:27.390
What?! Hold on a second, please.

00:07:27.390 --> 00:07:30.480
Then was the news about
her engagement being settled a lie?

00:07:30.480 --> 00:07:36.730
If she is fine with it, I will not oppose.
That is a kind of permission.

00:07:36.730 --> 00:07:40.390
Just as expected, old man.
You're making sure you won't lose.

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:45.640
According to the Adventurers' way,
you find your own spouses, do you not?

00:07:45.640 --> 00:07:48.560
But the princess isn't one of us.

00:07:48.560 --> 00:07:52.560
I thought accepting her
as your ambassador to Akiba

00:07:52.560 --> 00:07:56.730
was going to be beneficial for both sides.

00:07:56.730 --> 00:07:59.520
That would be the same with the Saiguu Family.

00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:02.480
My, my... Madam Sarariya!

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:05.230
If Rayneshia marries into the Saiguu Family,

00:08:05.230 --> 00:08:09.350
the friction with Westelande
will be appeased, if only a little.

00:08:09.350 --> 00:08:11.480
If I may borrow your words,

00:08:11.480 --> 00:08:15.140
whether we send Rayneshia
to Akiba or the Saiguu Family,

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:18.270
I do not think it changes
the merit to each of us.

00:08:18.270 --> 00:08:21.390
Oh crap. She knows what I'm thinking.

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:26.230
In regard to the downsides of her leaving Akiba,

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:29.980
I heard Sir Isaac there will look after Itherus.

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:33.020
Things will not be the same, of course,

00:08:33.020 --> 00:08:38.560
but if there is a new
turn of fate, it'll continue.

00:08:38.560 --> 00:08:45.190
But isn't that going to leave us,
Shopping Street 8, with hard feelings?

00:08:45.190 --> 00:08:48.850
Yes... I am very sorry about it.

00:08:50.230 --> 00:08:51.310
What?

00:08:52.560 --> 00:08:55.390
I need a strategist...

00:08:55.390 --> 00:08:58.980
...one who gives the path to my ideal.

00:08:58.980 --> 00:09:02.390
"Bring all the Akiba Adventurers a smile."

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:07.100
I'll leave all policies other
than that ideal to you, Mr. Shiroe.

00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:11.690
I will guarantee the treatment
of everyone in Log Horizon.

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:15.310
Eins was suffering, too.

00:09:15.310 --> 00:09:18.270
Because he knew Akiba wasn't in perfect shape,

00:09:18.270 --> 00:09:23.060
he kept struggling to look for
the best way to make everyone happy.

00:09:23.060 --> 00:09:27.770
Eins and I might've been standing
in the same place all this time.

00:09:27.770 --> 00:09:31.350
How should I respond to his request?

00:09:31.350 --> 00:09:33.350
Fortunately, I'm in a position to receive

00:09:33.350 --> 00:09:36.890
strong support from the People of the Land.

00:09:36.890 --> 00:09:38.600
The Saiguu Family, right?

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:42.350
No matter the form, power is power.

00:09:42.350 --> 00:09:45.940
I'm no longer so idealistic
that I would refuse it.

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:50.140
Since I'm an attendant, I've been
listening quietly, but how rude of you.

00:09:50.140 --> 00:09:55.560
Our Holy Empire of Westelande is
a lineal descent of Yamato's head family!

00:09:55.560 --> 00:09:58.850
As one might put it, it holds
the highest authority in this land.

00:09:58.850 --> 00:10:03.690
I'd like you all to pay more respect!

00:10:03.690 --> 00:10:05.940
That's enough, Malves.

00:10:05.940 --> 00:10:08.140
Mr. Saiguu, right?

00:10:08.140 --> 00:10:13.480
So, this is the strategist of
rare excellence who leads Akiba...

00:10:13.480 --> 00:10:16.850
I am Utena Itsukinomiya Touri.

00:10:16.850 --> 00:10:22.940
I was looking forward to seeing you,
Shiroe of Log Horizon.

00:10:18.590 --> 00:10:23.010
Utena Itsukinomiya Touri
 - Human - Saiguu

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:31.100
You're talking about Krusty?

00:10:31.100 --> 00:10:34.270
He is the knight who took my daughter away.

00:10:34.270 --> 00:10:38.390
Do you not think he should
come to see me at least once?

00:10:38.390 --> 00:10:40.100
Well...

00:10:40.100 --> 00:10:42.230
She is already 16.

00:10:42.230 --> 00:10:46.310
If she does not get married,
people could tell heartless tales about her.

00:10:46.310 --> 00:10:49.730
"I will take care of her."

00:10:49.730 --> 00:10:55.350
Is a simple phrase like
that too much to ask for?

00:10:55.350 --> 00:11:00.940
That being the case, it is hard to refuse
the request from the Saiguu Family

00:11:00.940 --> 00:11:05.230
and hence, it turned out this way.

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:12.060
So you want to leave it like that, huh?

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:14.310
If they make Krusty the bad guy, the relations

00:11:14.310 --> 00:11:18.940
between the Round Table Conference
and the Cowen Family won't go sour.

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:23.270
It seems that milord got dragged into
an accident and stuck on the continent.

00:11:23.270 --> 00:11:26.730
On top of that, he encountered
an enemy on their server

00:11:26.730 --> 00:11:29.190
and got something stolen.

00:11:29.190 --> 00:11:34.730
He said he'd fight and wouldn't
be back until he defeats the enemy.

00:11:34.730 --> 00:11:36.890
Is it some sort of a trial?

00:11:36.890 --> 00:11:38.390
Not at all.

00:11:39.230 --> 00:11:43.890
I'm able to finally accept
a fun thing as a fun thing.

00:11:43.890 --> 00:11:46.810
Those were his words.
It seems he has no complaints

00:11:46.810 --> 00:11:48.690
with the current situation, at least.

00:11:48.690 --> 00:11:54.060
Ahh, how stupid of me to worry
about that monster for even a moment.

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:58.810
"I'll abandon my house on Earth.
Please look after my house in Akiba."

00:11:58.810 --> 00:12:01.560
He said something like that too.

00:12:01.560 --> 00:12:04.890
Then your guild moved because...

00:12:04.890 --> 00:12:10.440
"Move" isn't really accurate.
We disbanded it entirely for the time being.

00:12:10.440 --> 00:12:16.980
We concluded that it'd be hard
to maintain things as-is otherwise.

00:12:16.980 --> 00:12:17.840
Disbanded...

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:21.230
D.D.D was the largest scale raid guild.

00:12:21.230 --> 00:12:26.980
It was unreasonable to manage it
in this world in the first place.

00:12:26.980 --> 00:12:31.140
But it is not something so bad, is it?

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:35.140
Right. "Hub" means the central part.

00:12:35.140 --> 00:12:39.890
D.D.D itself is disbanded,
but its scale won't be reduced.

00:12:39.890 --> 00:12:43.980
Rather, many guilds will be born from D.D.D.

00:12:43.980 --> 00:12:46.520
Many guilds...

00:12:46.520 --> 00:12:51.640
We'll make them independent
based on their fields and cooperate.

00:12:51.640 --> 00:12:56.060
We do feel worried,
but we're all ready and willing.

00:12:56.060 --> 00:12:58.270
I think what milord really wants is for us

00:12:58.270 --> 00:13:02.270
to surpass what he created and move forward.

00:13:02.270 --> 00:13:07.350
I can only be myself,
so all I can do is walk my own path.

00:13:07.350 --> 00:13:10.190
D.D.D will become a guild alliance.

00:13:10.190 --> 00:13:13.640
We'll widely accept the
People of the Land as members

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:18.350
and become a stronger place
suited to the current Akiba!

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:22.480
What's wrong?

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:25.350
Um... I was just surprised.

00:13:25.350 --> 00:13:29.310
Well... Why am I surprised?

00:13:29.310 --> 00:13:32.980
In the communication with milord, he also said,

00:13:32.980 --> 00:13:35.190
"If you're not upset
when something is taken away,

00:13:35.190 --> 00:13:39.440
it couldn't have been yours from the start."

00:13:42.310 --> 00:13:45.600
"If you're not upset
when something is taken away..."

00:13:49.440 --> 00:13:52.310
It could be just a joke, though.

00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:54.100
No, it is not.

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:58.640
No... He saw through me.

00:13:58.640 --> 00:14:02.390
He gave them a message
knowing what's going on here.

00:14:02.390 --> 00:14:03.730
That time, too.

00:14:03.730 --> 00:14:06.440
Decided not to slack off today?

00:14:06.440 --> 00:14:11.850
That monster always peeks into
my heart no matter how far away he is

00:14:11.850 --> 00:14:16.640
and correctly guesses things I don't even know.

00:14:16.640 --> 00:14:21.060
And then, he gives me encouragement.

00:14:21.060 --> 00:14:25.350
Something I get upset with...

00:14:25.350 --> 00:14:28.850
"Something you'd be upset
if it was taken away," right?

00:14:30.850 --> 00:14:33.480
Right.

00:14:33.480 --> 00:14:36.310
I'm sorry.

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:40.770
It seems there is something
I would get upset about.

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:47.310
This town, Akiba...

00:14:47.310 --> 00:14:49.600
...and my duties...

00:14:49.600 --> 00:14:51.520
...are important to me.

00:14:57.640 --> 00:15:01.690
I thought I should let you know
what's going on, more or less.

00:15:01.690 --> 00:15:05.390
To think the head of the
Saiguu Family, the leader of

00:15:05.390 --> 00:15:09.190
the Holy Empire of
Westelande himself, is here...

00:15:09.190 --> 00:15:12.140
I have heard of the name Master Mage Shiroe.

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:15.350
I just came to see his face.

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:17.770
He might be around my age.

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:20.980
The air he gives off is similar to... Krusty?

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:24.440
But his signs of presence
remind me of Isaac when he's angry.

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:26.600
His smiling eyes are like Sojiro's.

00:15:26.600 --> 00:15:31.060
Offering status and wealth
will not be enough to persuade you.

00:15:31.060 --> 00:15:35.440
We need to show all the cards
and face you with sincerity.

00:15:35.440 --> 00:15:38.440
That is how Eins advised me.

00:15:38.440 --> 00:15:41.230
He said you are worthy of doing so.

00:15:41.230 --> 00:15:42.940
Well, that's...

00:15:42.940 --> 00:15:44.140
How should I put it?

00:15:44.140 --> 00:15:47.440
He's kinda annoying,
or you're giving him too much credit.

00:15:47.440 --> 00:15:52.020
I wish he wouldn't say that out loud...
although they're sound remarks.

00:15:52.020 --> 00:15:59.100
I really doubt if this low-spirited,
dark-skinned four-eye weakling is worthy of it.

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:01.560
That's being too frank, though.

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:02.440
Show some restraint.

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:02.980
Yes, sir!

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:07.520
So Shiroe. What is your response?

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:11.520
If you please forgive my rudeness
for answering your question with another,

00:16:11.520 --> 00:16:14.190
how does this benefit you, Sir Touri?

00:16:14.190 --> 00:16:16.060
Address him as "Your Majesty"!

00:16:16.060 --> 00:16:19.480
I'm not employed by the Saiguu Family, so...

00:16:19.480 --> 00:16:20.730
Show some restraint, Malves.

00:16:20.730 --> 00:16:21.980
Yes, sir!

00:16:21.980 --> 00:16:25.600
Even if only half the achievements
I have been told of are true,

00:16:25.600 --> 00:16:28.730
he has the caliber to be a prime minister.

00:16:28.730 --> 00:16:33.890
I cannot afford to let a wise man
like him sit around doing nothing.

00:16:33.890 --> 00:16:36.140
You can't?

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:37.480
I cannot.

00:16:37.480 --> 00:16:40.190
Why is that?

00:16:40.190 --> 00:16:44.020
Because the Senate wishes to start a war.

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:45.850
I see...

00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:47.520
Listen, Shiroe.

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:48.770
Those nobles in the Lande Territory,

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:51.020
whose arrogance comes
from their being blue bloods,

00:16:51.020 --> 00:16:56.440
created the "Senate" and have been
conducting state affairs as they please.

00:16:56.440 --> 00:16:58.230
They aren't content with the West,

00:16:58.230 --> 00:17:02.980
so they're trying to extend
their ambitions to Eastal in the East.

00:17:02.980 --> 00:17:06.310
His Majesty became worried
about it and stood up!

00:17:06.310 --> 00:17:08.350
That's not true, Malves.

00:17:08.350 --> 00:17:09.600
Yes, sir!

00:17:09.600 --> 00:17:12.940
I am only a figurehead, after all.

00:17:12.940 --> 00:17:17.390
If Westelande was going
to gain Eastal without any problem,

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:20.730
I would have liked to spend
my time writing poems.

00:17:20.730 --> 00:17:25.560
However, once the war starts,
the flame may reduce not just Westelande

00:17:25.560 --> 00:17:29.140
to the ground, but all of Yamato.

00:17:29.140 --> 00:17:31.520
Operation: Red Night...

00:17:31.520 --> 00:17:34.020
The invasion plot by Minami.

00:17:34.020 --> 00:17:38.560
The Chief told me Plant Hwyaden
was also part of that plot.

00:17:39.940 --> 00:17:44.270
That was precisely the prime
example of the Senate's ambition.

00:17:44.270 --> 00:17:46.270
We don't have time.

00:17:46.270 --> 00:17:50.850
Are you saying you'll counter
the Senate by getting Akiba's support?

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:52.310
In the capital, someone named Intix,

00:17:52.310 --> 00:17:55.100
who is supported by the Senate,
is engaging in political strife

00:17:55.100 --> 00:17:58.480
with Nureha and her subordinates.

00:17:58.480 --> 00:18:03.020
While I do appreciate Nureha's loyalty,
the situation is unpredictable.

00:18:03.020 --> 00:18:06.100
The attempted assassination
of Prince Itherus, too?

00:18:06.100 --> 00:18:09.520
You should take it as their warning.

00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:11.600
I thought we should keep distance

00:18:11.600 --> 00:18:16.940
from the conflicts among the
People of the Land and have tried to do so.

00:18:16.940 --> 00:18:21.980
But collusive relationships
have already begun in many places.

00:18:21.980 --> 00:18:27.060
This meeting too. Nureha might've helped
to make it happen behind the scenes.

00:18:27.060 --> 00:18:32.730
Whether we like it or not,
we can no longer remain onlookers.

00:18:32.730 --> 00:18:34.600
After getting married to Rayneshia,

00:18:34.600 --> 00:18:36.810
I want to make the area
between Akiba and Boxroot

00:18:36.810 --> 00:18:41.020
a neutral area as the symbol of
the integration of the East and the West.

00:18:41.020 --> 00:18:44.390
In order to achieve it, help me, Shiroe.

00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:50.140
This is a duty imposed upon
all the people who live in Yamato.

00:18:50.140 --> 00:18:52.100
He's amazing...

00:18:52.100 --> 00:18:54.730
While considering his position
and the country's future,

00:18:54.730 --> 00:18:57.480
he's taking all the responsibility on himself.

00:18:57.480 --> 00:19:00.140
It should be that way.

00:19:00.140 --> 00:19:03.020
Even if I'm irresponsibly
determined to be an onlooker,

00:19:03.020 --> 00:19:09.390
there's no guarantee someone
would settle the situation.

00:19:09.390 --> 00:19:14.440
But I no longer... The Round Table
Conference no longer has that power.

00:19:24.060 --> 00:19:25.640
Princess Rayneshia...!

00:19:25.640 --> 00:19:28.480
Yeah. I contacted Akatsuki, so...

00:19:28.480 --> 00:19:29.690
What's the matter?

00:19:29.690 --> 00:19:32.520
Well... Her outfit...

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:35.600
Her outfit? That's the
Round Table Conference's, right?

00:19:35.600 --> 00:19:39.060
She insisted on wearing it.

00:19:39.060 --> 00:19:41.190
Don't scare me like that, shrimp!

00:19:41.190 --> 00:19:43.310
That settles it...

00:19:47.730 --> 00:19:49.520
That settles it...

00:19:53.020 --> 00:19:55.940
You are Sir Touri Saiguu, yes?

00:19:55.940 --> 00:20:00.270
I take you are Miss Rayneshia El Arte Cowen.

00:20:00.270 --> 00:20:05.100
I, the Imperial Prince Ikoma,
will be waiting for your arrival.

00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:07.560
No, Your Majesty.

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:11.270
I have unfinished business in this town.

00:20:11.270 --> 00:20:15.390
You can do it from the capital Kyo.

00:20:16.770 --> 00:20:20.230
It is a matter of where I would like to be.

00:20:24.310 --> 00:20:26.440
Her unfinished business is to become a bridge

00:20:26.440 --> 00:20:31.060
between the People of the Land
who come to this town and the Adventurers.

00:20:31.060 --> 00:20:36.520
She bears that responsibility and now is wearing
the Round Table Conference's uniform...

00:20:36.520 --> 00:20:41.440
Ahh... She's valued the Round Table Conference

00:20:41.440 --> 00:20:46.390
and had a high expectation
of it a lot more than I realized.

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:48.850
You think you can say such nonsense?!

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:51.520
Are you abandoning your duty as a young woman?!

00:20:51.520 --> 00:20:54.310
That is enough, Malves.

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:57.940
I have certainly received your answer.

00:20:57.940 --> 00:21:02.390
However, Shiroe...
I still have not heard your response.

00:21:02.390 --> 00:21:04.020
Right.

00:21:04.020 --> 00:21:05.810
Reconfigure quest.

00:21:05.810 --> 00:21:09.060
Conditions: While ending
the current Round Table Conference,

00:21:09.060 --> 00:21:12.060
get ready to accept someone who loves it.

00:21:12.060 --> 00:21:14.980
At the same time, fight Eins head-on.

00:21:14.980 --> 00:21:17.190
Do not lead or lose by too much,

00:21:17.190 --> 00:21:21.230
so the result can satisfy
everyone in its own way.

00:21:21.230 --> 00:21:26.440
Mr. Shiroe. Could you
please help us for Akiba's sake?

00:21:26.440 --> 00:21:28.350
I understand the situation.

00:21:28.350 --> 00:21:32.350
Holy Empire of Westelande and
the League of Freedom Cities Eastal.

00:21:32.350 --> 00:21:36.190
I do get your wish to avoid their clash.

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:38.690
Mr. Shiroe... Then...!

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:41.060
It seems that the quest has been accepted.

00:21:41.060 --> 00:21:42.100
What?

00:21:42.100 --> 00:21:46.140
"Create the Round Table Conference
and bring harmony and growth to Akiba."

00:21:46.140 --> 00:21:49.100
Everyone jumped to the conclusion that
the Round Table Conference was over.

00:21:49.100 --> 00:21:51.480
Even I, who created it, was about to let it go.

00:21:51.480 --> 00:21:56.810
But Princess Rayneshia still believed,
"It isn't over. It's needed."

00:21:56.810 --> 00:22:01.310
So I have to accept that quest from her.

00:22:01.310 --> 00:22:02.940
Sir Shiroe...

00:22:02.940 --> 00:22:07.060
There is more than one way.
We'll definitely do something about Akiba.

00:22:07.060 --> 00:22:10.350
I'm sure this town will
become better than it is now.

00:22:10.350 --> 00:22:12.690
So let's fight.

00:22:12.690 --> 00:22:14.020
Fight?!

00:22:14.020 --> 00:22:17.020
How dare you?! Are you being serious?!

00:22:17.020 --> 00:22:18.600
Please wait a second.

00:22:18.600 --> 00:22:22.850
I'm only a low-spirited,
dark-skinned four-eye weakling, after all.

00:22:22.850 --> 00:22:26.940
I can't think of a blood-shedding fight.

00:22:26.940 --> 00:22:28.810
Then how?

00:22:28.810 --> 00:22:30.520
How about by voting?

00:22:30.520 --> 00:22:36.350
We'll ask both Adventurers
and the People of the Land to vote.

00:22:36.350 --> 00:22:39.770
Let's settle this with an election.

00:24:12.690 --> 00:24:14.600
An announcement from the executive committee.

00:24:14.600 --> 00:24:16.350
It'll be held in the station square.

00:24:16.350 --> 00:24:18.850
You need to be an Akiba resident to participate.

00:24:18.850 --> 00:24:20.810
Everyone who comes to the premise on that day

00:24:20.810 --> 00:24:22.890
will be considered Akiba residents.

00:24:22.890 --> 00:24:24.810
One person casts one vote.

00:24:24.810 --> 00:24:27.810
A new Round Table Conference,
or the Akiba Government...

00:24:27.810 --> 00:24:30.440
You will decide the future of Akiba!

00:24:30.360 --> 00:24:36.990
Next Time

00:24:30.360 --> 00:24:36.990
Akiba General Election

00:24:30.440 --> 00:24:32.730
Next Time: "Akiba General Election."

00:24:32.730 --> 00:24:35.190
When things go past the
breaking point, rules change.
